WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
A small, fluffy desk companion. A softer place to land.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Tap Petal for a playful reply and a little affection.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Choose a mood. Explore gentle, clearly labeled sample replies.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Take a 60-second breathing break at your own comfortable pace.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.000
No perfect breathing. No pressure to be productive.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Choose one small task. Start, pause, or reset a 25-minute focus session.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Write, find, and save little notes. No perfect sentences needed.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Switch the interface between English and Chinese in one tap.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Web prototype today. A family of physical companion concepts for tomorrow.
